  "content": "<p>寫 Blog 其中一個樂趣，就是在網上衝浪時，發現自己的文章被提及、回應，甚至是延伸話題與討論了！</p>\n<p>於是決定做記錄，尤其是深度討論的文章們，會讓我覺得「果然用部落格才能達到真正的社群！」</p>\n<p>目前想到的小問題是，未來可能會變成超長清單，感覺就有點爲了列出而列出的感覺，但就先做吧！未來的事情未來再說。</p>\n<p>以下列出！</p>\n<div>\n  \n<div>\n  <h2>\n  提及與回應\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h2>\n\n<p>Wen - 〈<a href=\"https://www.wen-lab.tw/blog-one-year/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">部落格一年回顧</a>〉</p>\n<p>JN - 〈<a href=\"https://blog.giveanornot.com/choosing-hugo-theme/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">如何挑選 Hugo 的 Theme？怎麼避免踩坑？</a>〉</p>\n<p>Shuyu - <a href=\"https://shuyulin1127.com/now/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Now Page</a></p>\n<p>yangbear - 〈<a href=\"http://yangbear.bearblog.dev/seisanryoku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">部落格的產出時間</a>〉</p>\n<p>wen - 〈<a href=\"https://www.wen-lab.tw/ai-social-death/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AI 社死現場</a>〉</p>\n<p>Til by 廢文小天地 - 〈<a href=\"https://til.trashposts.com/blog/telegram-notify\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">如何用 Telegram 傳送通知給自己</a>〉</p>\n<p>shuojen - 〈<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/blog/2026/04/25/recipe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">蛋沙拉食譜</a>〉</p>\n<p>ikuka - 〈<a href=\"https://blog.ikukaroom.com/how-to-say-dry-eye-in-japanese/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">乾眼症的日文怎麼說？</a>〉</p>\n<p>Wiwi - 〈<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/content-gold-ratio/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">含金量</a>〉</p>\n<p>皮皮 -〈<a href=\"https://trashposts.com/blog/cozy-room-lighting/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">用燈光打造更舒適的房間</a>〉</p>\n<p>Timo - 〈<a href=\"https://timoblog.com/post/only-me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">只有我這樣嗎？</a>〉</p>\n<p>ttheng’s microblog -〈<a href=\"https://microblog.ttheng.com/e-learning-monthly-comic/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《e 起學習》月刊：好懷念啊</a>〉</p>\n<p>Alex Hsu - 〈<a href=\"https://alexhsu.com/reach-out\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">想交新朋友？試試主動出擊</a>〉</p>\n<p>Hsun - 〈<a href=\"https://hsun.bearblog.dev/online-patrolling/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">海巡</a>〉</p>\n<p>JN - 〈<a href=\"https://blog.giveanornot.com/center-of-the-universe/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">憑什麼我不能是宇宙的中心？</a>〉</p>\n<p>AngelCl - 〈<a href=\"https://angeci.github.io/blog/personal-brand-domain/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Personal Brand Domain</a>〉</p>\n<p>Tux24 -〈<a href=\"https://tux24.xyz/articles/part-x/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Pt. X</a>〉</p>\n<p>Daisy - 〈<a href=\"https://daisy27.bearblog.dev/im-alive/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天啊!居然真的有人在看我?! I’m alive!</a>〉</p>\n<p>PuzeLee - 〈<a href=\"https://puzelee.cc/posts/bao-bao-everyday-24-not-boring-day/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">每日包叫 #24：以為今天是無聊的一天</a>〉</p>\n<p>Jerry - 〈<a href=\"https://itsxiaobai.github.io/blog/random-thought-6/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">隨機的想法</a>〉</p>\n<p>Shuyu - 〈<a href=\"https://shuyulin1127.com/publii-and-my-website-dream/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Publii 與我的圖庫夢</a>〉</p>\n\n</div>\n  <div>\n  <h2>\n  延伸話題與討論\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h2>\n\n<p>Wiwi - 〈<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/files-over-apps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">你不需要 App，你需要檔案</a>〉</p>\n<p>Wiwi - 〈<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/public-private-message\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">公開私訊體</a>〉</p>\n<p>Marcus - 〈<a href=\"https://immarcus.com/blog/weekly-20260412/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2026.04.12 博客阅读周记</a>〉</p>\n<p>YangBear - 〈<a href=\"https://yangbear.bearblog.dev/7918/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">電腦小白學用終端機</a>〉</p>\n<p>It’s小白不是小白 - 〈<a href=\"https://itsxiaobai.github.io/blog/protrait/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">關於街拍</a>〉</p>\n<p>shuojen - 〈<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/blog/2026/04/20/street%20photography\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">街拍</a>〉</p>\n<p>Marcus - 〈<a href=\"https://immarcus.com/blog/weekly-20260426/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2026.04.26 博客阅读周记</a>〉</p>\n<p>shuyulin - 〈<a href=\"https://shuyulin1127.com/2026-04-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2026.04 回顧</a>〉</p>\n<p>e89295- 〈<a href=\"https://e89295.com/blog/2026-01-12.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">我覺得用手工編輯 HTML 的方式寫部落格文章很好</a>〉</p>\n<p>JN - 〈<a href=\"https://blog.giveanornot.com/indieping/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">要怎麼知道別人在部落格提到了自己？部落格該怎麼海巡？</a>〉<br>\n（特別感謝 JN 讓我找回那些曾提及我，但我忘記了的那些文章，而且我的舊網域 blog.gtisland.com 竟然也有被列進去！）</p>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
